error[SCXML092]: the inline schema of `<transition>` has a reference the compiler cannot keep: `item.json` at `/properties/item/$ref` names another resource
 --> tests/ui/scxml092-event-schema-external-ref.scxml:6:82
  |
6 |                 event:schema='{"type": "object", "properties": {"item": {"$ref": "item.json"}}}'/>
  |                                                                                  ^^^^^^^^^^^ references another resource
  |
  = note: no schema is fetched: a `$ref` may only name a fragment of the same file (`#/$defs/Item`); when `event:schema` selects part of a file with a pointer, the references it uses are bundled into the result, which is impossible for schemas that rely on `$id`, `$anchor`, plain-name fragments, or dynamic references
  = help: copy the referenced schema into the same file and reference it by JSON Pointer, or reference the whole file without a fragment
  = spec: JSON Schema 2020-12 Core

